Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.95,0:03:09.66,OPCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\be3}不知何时  伤口已经痊愈 yeah
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.33,0:03:12.75,OPCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\be3}Woo
