Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.55,0:21:26.30,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}よふかしのうた
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.43,0:21:28.43,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}照らしてって moonlight
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.59,0:21:30.43,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}目を奪ってブルーライト
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.72,0:21:32.85,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}ネオンサインが呼ぶ表裏
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.85,0:21:34.85,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}よふかしのうた
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.85,0:21:36.77,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}連れ去って midnight
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.94,0:21:38.69,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}血走った red eyes
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.85,0:21:41.77,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}大人達の子守唄
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.82,0:21:43.98,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}ガキの頃から夜が好きだった
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.98,0:21:46.03,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}9時に寝るのは何か嫌だった
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.03,0:21:48.16,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}なんと無くただ勿体無かった
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.16,0:21:50.28,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}お前の事がもっと知りたかった
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.82,0:21:52.58,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}いわゆる三文の得
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.58,0:21:55.50,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}投げ売ってでも見たいのさ もっと奥の奥の奥
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.50,0:21:56.79,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}色濃く紐解く
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.79,0:21:59.00,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}12オクロックから丑の刻まで
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.08,0:22:00.96,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}初めてお前を跨いだのは、
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.04,0:22:03.75,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}いや初めて跨ったのは確か14
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.84,0:22:05.42,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}俺は何も知らねワナビー
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.42,0:22:07.51,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}手取り足取り全てが新しい
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.51,0:22:08.59,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}姿形にその香り
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.59,0:22:11.35,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}静けさが似合うその黒い肌に
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.97,0:22:14.85,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}吸い込まれてた 手招きされるままに
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.06,0:22:17.98,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}それからお前は音楽をくれた
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.98,0:22:19.81,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}女の裸も見せてくれた
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.90,0:22:22.15,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}飲んだ事ねぇ酒に口つけて
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.27,0:22:24.19,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}オトンのタバコくすね火を付けた
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.32,0:22:25.65,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}やっちゃいけないが溢れて
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.65,0:22:27.65,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}知っちゃいけないに塗れてる
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.20,0:22:29.91,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}迎えに来る闇に紛れて
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.95,0:22:31.53,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}お前はいつも気まぐれで…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.53,0:22:33.37,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}よふかしのうた
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.37,0:22:35.45,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}照らしてって moonlight
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.45,0:22:37.29,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}目を奪ってブルーライト
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.37,0:22:39.54,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}ネオンサインが呼ぶ表裏
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.54,0:22:41.67,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}よふかしのうた
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.67,0:22:43.54,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}連れ去って midnight
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.54,0:22:45.80,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}血走った red eyes
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.80,0:22:48.55,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}大人達の子守唄
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.55,0:21:26.30,EDCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}彻夜之歌
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.43,0:21:28.43,EDCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}明亮的月光
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.59,0:21:30.43,EDCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}夺目的蓝光
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.72,0:21:32.85,EDCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}霓虹灯唤醒了内心的表里
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.85,0:21:34.85,EDCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}彻夜之歌
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.85,0:21:36.77,EDCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}把我们带进深夜
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.94,0:21:38.69,EDCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}馋涎欲垂的赤瞳
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.85,0:21:41.77,EDCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}大人们的摇篮曲
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.82,0:21:43.98,EDCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}我从儿时就喜欢夜晚
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.98,0:21:46.03,EDCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}不知为何不喜欢在九点睡觉
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.03,0:21:48.16,EDCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}就是感觉很可惜
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.16,0:21:50.28,EDCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}想要更深入地了解你
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.82,0:21:52.58,EDCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}也就是所谓的占小便宜
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.58,0:21:55.50,EDCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}即使亏本也想继续深入地了解
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.50,0:21:56.79,EDCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}了解的彻彻底底
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.79,0:21:59.00,EDCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}从12点一直到丑时
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.08,0:22:00.96,EDCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}第一次横跨是
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.04,0:22:03.75,EDCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}不对  第一次横跨是在14岁的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.84,0:22:05.42,EDCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}我是什么也不懂的wannabe
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.42,0:22:07.51,EDCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}一切都对我来说是新鲜的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.51,0:22:08.59,EDCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}你的姿态和气味
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.59,0:22:11.35,EDCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}被你那融入寂静的黑色肌肤
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.97,0:22:14.85,EDCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}所吸引  无法抵抗
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.06,0:22:17.98,EDCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}然后你给我推荐了音乐
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.98,0:22:19.81,EDCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}也给我看了女人的赤裸
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.90,0:22:22.15,EDCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}第一次喝了酒
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.27,0:22:24.19,EDCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}点了从爸爸那里偷的烟
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.32,0:22:25.65,EDCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}干了太多不能干的事
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.65,0:22:27.65,EDCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}知道了不该知道的事
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.20,0:22:29.91,EDCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}我被迎来的黑夜所吞噬
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.95,0:22:31.53,EDCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}你却一直很随心所欲
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.53,0:22:33.37,EDCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}彻夜之歌
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.37,0:22:35.45,EDCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}明亮的月光
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.45,0:22:37.29,EDCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}夺目的蓝光
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.37,0:22:39.54,EDCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}霓虹灯唤醒了内心的表里
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.54,0:22:41.67,EDCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}彻夜之歌
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.67,0:22:43.54,EDCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}把我们带进深夜
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.54,0:22:45.80,EDCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}馋涎欲垂的赤瞳
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.80,0:22:48.55,EDCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}大人们的摇篮曲
Comment: 0,0:00:01.00,0:00:01.00,Comment,,0,0,0,,——Title——
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.97,0:12:27.97,Title,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1002,686)\c&HFFFFFF&}第3夜:出了好多啊
Comment: 0,0:00:01.02,0:00:01.02,Comment,,0,0,0,,——Text——
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.27,0:00:01.81,Default,,0,0,0,,夜守
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.06,0:00:03.89,Default,,0,0,0,,你在干什么
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.52,0:00:07.23,Default,,0,0,0,,明…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.24,0:00:20.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我之前想问你
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.04,0:00:23.08,Default,,0,0,0,,你真的一个朋友都没有吗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.42,0:00:27.42,Default,,0,0,0,,你这是什么表情
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.96,0:00:33.09,Default,,0,0,0,,从什么阶段开始才算是朋友呢
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.76,0:00:38.47,Default,,0,0,0,,那个…这是什么问题
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.93,0:00:40.35,Default,,0,0,0,,就是字面的意思
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.18,0:00:42.64,Default,,0,0,0,,从什么阶段…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.19,0:00:47.27,Default,,0,0,0,,自己认为是朋友的话就是了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.36,0:00:51.98,Default,,0,0,0,,认为是朋友…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.36,0:00:56.03,Default,,0,0,0,,不好意思  这个问题对你来说还是有点难了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.70,0:00:57.70,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.70,0:01:02.16,Default,,0,0,0,,即使没跟对方说我们是朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.54,0:01:03.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我也可以这么认为吗
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.29,0:01:06.58,Default,,0,0,0,,你没有朋友  所以不懂
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.71,0:01:09.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我小时候还是有朋友的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.96,0:01:11.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我们经常一起玩来着
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.84,0:01:18.39,Default,,0,0,0,,把一个很久没有见面的人称为朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.39,0:01:20.43,Default,,0,0,0,,是不是不太礼貌
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.26,0:01:23.52,Default,,0,0,0,,你不是那种不需要朋友的人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.81,0:01:26.56,Default,,0,0,0,,这个可悲的对讲机
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.56,0:01:31.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我记得是想要和别人交流用的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.65,0:01:35.74,Default,,0,0,0,,也就是说你当时想要朋友吗
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.24,0:01:39.95,Default,,0,0,0,,也许…是这样吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.92,0:03:19.76,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么你有我的对讲机
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.63,0:03:21.88,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.76,0:03:25.05,Default,,0,0,0,,因为是你给我的所以没扔掉
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.43,0:03:28.10,Default,,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.64,0:03:29.56,Default,,0,0,0,,什么情况
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.52,0:03:32.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我给…她的?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.31,0:03:35.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我们一直都不是同班同学
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.44,0:03:39.90,Default,,0,0,0,,你从小学六年级开始变得开朗  朋友也多了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.40,0:03:42.57,Default,,0,0,0,,所以一直没能搭上话
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.28,0:03:46.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我等你呼叫我  却一直没有
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.24,0:03:50.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我以为你忘了  所以就没放在心上
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.79,0:03:53.08,Default,,0,0,0,,你最近没有来上学
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.33,0:03:55.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我就呼叫你  问你还好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.96,0:03:57.54,Default,,0,0,0,,然后在附近听到一些声音
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.30,0:03:59.34,Default,,0,0,0,,吓了我一跳
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.75,0:04:01.26,Default,,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.55,0:04:04.13,Default,,0,0,0,,那个对讲机是我亲手给你的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.43,0:04:04.76,Default,,0,0,0,,不是
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.22,0:04:05.76,Default,,0,0,0,,对啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.39,0:04:06.76,Default,,0,0,0,,那你…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.85,0:04:09.64,Default,,0,0,0,,你不是放在我家的信箱上了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.14,0:04:15.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我才知道明的门牌号…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.48,0:04:19.98,Default,,0,0,0,,明  那个…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.36,0:04:22.94,Default,,0,0,0,,你过得好就行
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.61,0:04:26.70,Default,,0,0,0,,最近大家对你的印象都颠覆了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.16,0:04:29.91,Default,,0,0,0,,夜守  你之前很内向
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.66,0:04:31.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我还担心来着
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.45,0:04:33.37,Default,,0,0,0,,作为你的朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.42,0:04:38.21,Default,,0,0,0,,朋…友
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.34,0:04:41.00,Default,,0,0,0,,你很冷淡
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.46,0:04:45.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我还担心你不认为我们是朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.05,0:04:49.89,Default,,0,0,0,,不过你绞尽脑汁  把心意化为实物
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.60,0:04:51.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我很开心
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.10,0:04:52.72,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.43,0:04:55.10,Default,,0,0,0,,这个…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.02,0:04:57.27,Default,,0,0,0,,这种误解…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.15,0:05:00.82,Default,,0,0,0,,也太糟糕了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.96,0:05:16.58,Default,,0,0,0,,你也来一起玩嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.96,0:05:17.87,Default,,0,0,0,,你在干什么
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.21,0:05:22.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我在看蚂蚁搬虫子的尸体
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.55,0:05:25.13,Default,,0,0,0,,你到底在干什么
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.88,0:05:27.22,Default,,0,0,0,,很有意思的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.18,0:05:30.72,Default,,0,0,0,,又不是跑来跑去才算玩
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.72,0:05:37.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我认为我在跟你们玩  所以不用管我
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.24,0:05:52.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我们是朋友吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.70,0:05:55.04,Default,,0,0,0,,不是  呃…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.21,0:05:58.83,Default,,0,0,0,,应该是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.33,0:06:01.04,Default,,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.22,0:06:13.85,Default,,0,0,0,,明
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.64,0:06:19.64,Default,,0,0,0,,好久不见
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.81,0:06:21.15,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.48,0:06:28.07,Default,,0,0,0,,说起来你为什么穿着校服啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.53,0:06:29.28,Default,,0,0,0,,现在才回家吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.61,0:06:31.95,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么可能  我现在正要去学校
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.24,0:06:33.53,Default,,0,0,0,,这是四点啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.58,0:06:34.41,Default,,0,0,0,,还在深夜啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.49,0:06:35.33,Default,,0,0,0,,这是早上啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.20,0:06:37.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我起得很早
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.37,0:06:40.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我散步之后才去上学
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.42,0:06:41.33,Default,,0,0,0,,无法理解
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.75,0:06:42.96,Default,,0,0,0,,你在干什么呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.88,0:06:46.50,Default,,0,0,0,,回家顺便散步…吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.05,0:06:48.05,Default,,0,0,0,,那…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.92,0:06:51.55,Default,,0,0,0,,明天也能在这个时间见到你吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.89,0:06:59.10,Default,,0,0,0,,喂  你叫我干什么
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.27,0:07:01.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我正要睡觉呢  请讲
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.94,0:07:02.52,Default,,0,0,0,,小荠
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.27,0:07:04.11,Default,,0,0,0,,听我说
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.40,0:07:07.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我好像有朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.44,0:07:08.86,Default,,0,0,0,,有一个
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.78,0:07:11.91,Default,,0,0,0,,这么少
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.41,0:07:14.03,Default,,0,0,0,,晚安
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.59,0:07:30.72,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么最近回去得这么早
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.97,0:07:31.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我说光君
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.30,0:07:34.34,Default,,0,0,0,,是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.80,0:07:36.22,Default,,0,0,0,,已经三点半了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.39,0:07:39.52,Default,,0,0,0,,喂  夜晚才刚刚开始啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.48,0:07:43.65,Default,,0,0,0,,说「刚开始」是不是有点过分
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.94,0:07:48.27,Default,,0,0,0,,结束之后立刻回家
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.65,0:07:50.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我们只是肉体上的关系啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.57,0:07:52.90,Default,,0,0,0,,这么做的难道不是你吗!?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.99,0:07:55.53,Default,,0,0,0,,没事  我无所谓
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.62,0:07:58.12,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么总是这样!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.33,0:08:01.58,Default,,0,0,0,,要去别的女人那里吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.83,0:08:03.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.75,0:08:07.21,Default,,0,0,0,,不…不是
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.42,0:08:12.55,Default,,0,0,0,,诶  真的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.13,0:08:14.34,Default,,0,0,0,,不…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.34,0:08:17.43,Default,,0,0,0,,不是不是
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.76,0:08:19.26,Default,,0,0,0,,真的不是那样
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.47,0:08:20.01,Default,,0,0,0,,真的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.47,0:08:22.64,Default,,0,0,0,,真…真的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.10,0:08:24.48,Default,,0,0,0,,那明天见
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.64,0:08:25.56,Default,,0,0,0,,再见  小荠
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.90,0:08:30.78,Default,,0,0,0,,喝不下了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.53,0:08:32.28,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.61,0:08:37.20,Default,,0,0,0,,明!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.25,0:08:44.75,Default,,0,0,0,,哟
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.50,0:08:48.54,Default,,0,0,0,,你跑来的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.09,0:08:50.75,Default,,0,0,0,,啊…嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.51,0:08:55.01,Default,,0,0,0,,跟小荠玩耍后
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.59,0:08:58.64,Default,,0,0,0,,与上学前的明见面  已经成为了我的习惯
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.85,0:09:03.48,Default,,0,0,0,,但我们也没聊什么重要的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.18,0:09:07.23,Default,,0,0,0,,有时候聊一聊家常而已
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.19,0:09:12.61,Default,,0,0,0,,话说我记得她以前爱说话  很开朗的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.32,0:09:15.82,Default,,0,0,0,,不是这样的气场…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.49,0:09:18.91,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.32,0:09:23.58,Default,,0,0,0,,没怎么…我在想你和我在一起开心吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.04,0:09:27.54,Default,,0,0,0,,你不开心吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.50,0:09:30.21,Default,,0,0,0,,也不是不开心
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.21,0:09:31.96,Default,,0,0,0,,那就好
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.75,0:09:34.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我很开心
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.38,0:09:41.39,Default,,0,0,0,,那么…如果不是这样也就算了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.14,0:09:44.47,Default,,0,0,0,,但这是那啥吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.48,0:09:48.06,Default,,0,0,0,,这家伙喜欢我吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.77,0:09:51.06,Default,,0,0,0,,如果是这样的话…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.24,0:10:02.28,Default,,0,0,0,,原来是这样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.74,0:10:03.62,Default,,0,0,0,,什么  这是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.79,0:10:06.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我还想你偷偷摸摸干什么
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.83,0:10:08.25,Default,,0,0,0,,她生气了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.79,0:10:09.54,Default,,0,0,0,,生气了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.42,0:10:11.17,Default,,0,0,0,,不好
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.58,0:10:15.21,Default,,0,0,0,,怎…怎…么办
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.21,0:10:18.01,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么在这种地方幽会呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.05,0:10:20.39,Default,,0,0,0,,你这家伙  可真行
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.68,0:10:21.97,Default,,0,0,0,,幽会?  那是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.01,0:10:25.56,Default,,0,0,0,,年轻男女在这个时间会干的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.64,0:10:26.81,Default,,0,0,0,,除了幽会还有什么
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.89,0:10:29.27,Default,,0,0,0,,幽会…幽会是什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.31,0:10:32.11,Default,,0,0,0,,是你认识的人吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.56,0:10:33.15,Default,,0,0,0,,算是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.36,0:10:34.98,Default,,0,0,0,,没事没事
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.11,0:10:37.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我和这家伙只是肉体上的关系
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.24,0:10:38.53,Default,,0,0,0,,放心吧  小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.53,0:10:39.90,Default,,0,0,0,,别说得这么奇怪
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.28,0:10:43.91,Default,,0,0,0,,夜守  你不来学校没关系
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.41,0:10:46.33,Default,,0,0,0,,但是不要玩坏事
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.37,0:10:47.75,Default,,0,0,0,,不…不是
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.95,0:10:49.12,Default,,0,0,0,,听见了吗  光君…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.12,0:10:50.87,Default,,0,0,0,,小荠  请你先别说话
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.29,0:10:54.34,Default,,0,0,0,,光君…小荠…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.63,0:10:58.21,Default,,0,0,0,,原来是那种关系啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.84,0:11:00.93,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道什么了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.59,0:11:03.22,Default,,0,0,0,,所以说只是肉体上的…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.30,0:11:04.39,Default,,0,0,0,,你好烦啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.55,0:11:06.43,Default,,0,0,0,,你喜欢那个人吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.14,0:11:07.77,Default,,0,0,0,,真好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.02,0:11:10.35,Default,,0,0,0,,别说「喜欢」啊  真让我难为情
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.85,0:11:11.64,Default,,0,0,0,,害羞了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.19,0:11:13.35,Default,,0,0,0,,真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.56,0:11:14.48,Default,,0,0,0,,别说了别说了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.56,0:11:17.44,Default,,0,0,0,,学生总是把事情往恋爱上扯
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.48,0:11:19.44,Default,,0,0,0,,你为什么脸红啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.57,0:11:20.19,Default,,0,0,0,,你真烦啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.28,0:11:21.28,Default,,0,0,0,,闭嘴  小屁孩
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.82,0:11:23.57,Default,,0,0,0,,真拿你没办法
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.70,0:11:26.45,Default,,0,0,0,,光君  站起来一下
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.58,0:11:32.75,Default,,0,0,0,,让你看看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.42,0:11:35.96,Default,,0,0,0,,别移开眼睛
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.00,0:11:38.30,Default,,0,0,0,,等等  真的要来吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.52,0:11:50.98,Default,,0,0,0,,不…不要了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.06,0:11:55.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我朋友还在这里  别吸了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.98,0:11:57.57,Default,,0,0,0,,好喝
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.82,0:12:00.11,Default,,0,0,0,,发…发生了什么
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.74,0:12:01.78,Default,,0,0,0,,那是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.86,0:12:03.15,Default,,0,0,0,,脖子…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.36,0:12:06.32,Default,,0,0,0,,她吸了血?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.37,0:12:09.95,Default,,0,0,0,,你到底是什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.42,0:12:17.09,Default,,0,0,0,,那肯定是吸血鬼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.31,0:12:32.68,Default,,0,0,0,,你们也点啤酒吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.89,0:12:33.85,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么可能
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.39,0:12:37.31,Default,,0,0,0,,那个…我要早餐和热咖啡
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.98,0:12:38.52,Default,,0,0,0,,你呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.90,0:12:41.44,Default,,0,0,0,,那我也要热咖啡
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.90,0:12:42.90,Default,,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.15,0:12:44.78,Default,,0,0,0,,搞什么啊  真没劲
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.99,0:12:47.37,Default,,0,0,0,,未成年人不可以喝酒哦
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.58,0:12:51.79,Default,,0,0,0,,夜守  我重新问你一遍
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.04,0:12:53.04,Default,,0,0,0,,这个人到底是干什么的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.41,0:12:54.29,Default,,0,0,0,,那个…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.37,0:12:56.75,Default,,0,0,0,,服务员  再来一杯酒
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.38,0:13:02.92,Default,,0,0,0,,你为什么让她吸你的血?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.22,0:13:07.22,Default,,0,0,0,,你们一直这样吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.01,0:13:10.18,Default,,0,0,0,,跟你不来学校有关系吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.81,0:13:16.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得你不想说  所以没问你
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.27,0:13:19.90,Default,,0,0,0,,你为什么不来学校了?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.15,0:13:22.73,Default,,0,0,0,,不去学校又不会死
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.90,0:13:24.61,Default,,0,0,0,,去了也没用
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.90,0:13:26.82,Default,,0,0,0,,怪物请先闭嘴
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.07,0:13:28.70,Default,,0,0,0,,怪…怪物?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.53,0:13:31.99,Default,,0,0,0,,喂  光君  这家伙挺有意思的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.62,0:13:33.24,Default,,0,0,0,,这样吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.16,0:13:36.58,Default,,0,0,0,,明
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.12,0:13:37.54,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.71,0:13:41.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我没跟你说是我的错
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.21,0:13:45.05,Default,,0,0,0,,可是我不知道该怎么跟你说
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.05,0:13:49.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我一直以为我在学校混得不错
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.30,0:13:55.02,Default,,0,0,0,,可是感到什么都不想做  很无聊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.56,0:14:00.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道我该如何面对这种心情
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.77,0:14:02.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我跟你一样
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.61,0:14:05.82,Default,,0,0,0,,不管是在学校还是在家都很无聊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.53,0:14:07.70,Default,,0,0,0,,但是我必须去
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.24,0:14:11.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我也会分不清到底是不是朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.58,0:14:15.58,Default,,0,0,0,,所以久违地见到你  我很高兴
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.25,0:14:19.17,Default,,0,0,0,,见到了跟小学时一样的你
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.84,0:14:26.30,Default,,0,0,0,,夜守  我们一起去学校吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.55,0:14:30.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我有你更开心
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.26,0:14:31.97,Default,,0,0,0,,明…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.02,0:14:45.86,Default,,0,0,0,,小姐  你很有意思呀
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.36,0:14:47.94,Default,,0,0,0,,您贵姓啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.28,0:14:51.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我是七草荠  是吸血鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.87,0:14:55.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我是朝井明  是人类
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.20,0:15:00.04,Default,,0,0,0,,首先  不太明白你所说的吸血鬼…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.16,0:15:02.04,Default,,0,0,0,,你不理解也没关系
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.21,0:15:04.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是自己想成为吸血鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.75,0:15:08.97,Default,,0,0,0,,朝井  你是光君的朋友吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.55,0:15:11.01,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.47,0:15:14.47,Default,,0,0,0,,听你说很久没见他了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.85,0:15:16.47,Default,,0,0,0,,你一直在干什么来着
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.64,0:15:19.56,Default,,0,0,0,,没联系他吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.78,0:15:30.24,Default,,0,0,0,,回家了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.12,0:15:32.49,Default,,0,0,0,,小荠
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.95,0:15:40.37,Default,,0,0,0,,小荠竟然没付钱就走了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.71,0:15:41.79,Default,,0,0,0,,那个人到底怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.96,0:15:47.50,Default,,0,0,0,,夜守?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.80,0:15:48.21,Default,,0,0,0,,给你
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.06,0:15:59.81,Default,,0,0,0,,她是在生气吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.56,0:16:01.89,Default,,0,0,0,,是因为明吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.60,0:16:03.85,Default,,0,0,0,,可就因为这种事…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.52,0:16:06.27,Default,,0,0,0,,明只是朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.81,0:16:09.90,Default,,0,0,0,,而且她刚才挺开心的  还喝了酒
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.69,0:16:12.45,Default,,0,0,0,,那个…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.99,0:16:15.82,Default,,0,0,0,,你生气了?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.41,0:16:17.33,Default,,0,0,0,,没生气
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.87,0:16:18.41,Default,,0,0,0,,明明生气了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.41,0:16:19.70,Default,,0,0,0,,都说了没生气
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.41,0:16:22.25,Default,,0,0,0,,那你在搞什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.71,0:16:27.21,Default,,0,0,0,,你不说为什么生气  我怎么知道啊  小荠
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.25,0:16:28.50,Default,,0,0,0,,哎呀  烦死啦
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.67,0:16:30.38,Default,,0,0,0,,烦死啦  大傻子
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.50,0:16:31.80,Default,,0,0,0,,你这个废物
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.30,0:16:33.93,Default,,0,0,0,,这种事情你自己想去
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.97,0:16:35.13,Default,,0,0,0,,你果然在生气…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.30,0:16:40.01,Default,,0,0,0,,喂  你去哪里啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.64,0:16:45.73,Default,,0,0,0,,可恶  她到底在对什么生气
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.65,0:16:50.48,Default,,0,0,0,,可恶  怎么可能让你甩掉我
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.61,0:16:55.11,Default,,0,0,0,,被彻底甩掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.14,0:18:03.14,Default,,0,0,0,,找不到
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.18,0:18:07.85,Default,,0,0,0,,不懂她为什么生气
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.27,0:18:09.90,Default,,0,0,0,,这算是吵架吗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.02,0:18:14.36,Default,,0,0,0,,好疼…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.98,0:18:16.99,Default,,0,0,0,,希望牙没碎
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.09,0:18:35.13,Default,,0,0,0,,那个…小荠?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.96,0:18:37.51,Default,,0,0,0,,那个…对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.22,0:18:38.80,Default,,0,0,0,,请讲
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.18,0:18:43.76,Default,,0,0,0,,什么对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.64,0:18:47.68,Default,,0,0,0,,因为你在生气
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.18,0:18:51.60,Default,,0,0,0,,你因为对方生气才道歉吗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.61,0:18:55.86,Default,,0,0,0,,是因为我背着你跟朋友见面吗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.07,0:18:59.32,Default,,0,0,0,,啊  为什么我要对这种事生气?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.07,0:19:03.99,Default,,0,0,0,,你有朋友不是很好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.29,0:19:07.08,Default,,0,0,0,,小荠
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.87,0:19:10.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我没怎么吵过架
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.17,0:19:14.21,Default,,0,0,0,,所以真的不懂你为什么生气
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.04,0:19:17.09,Default,,0,0,0,,如果可以的话请告诉我
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.71,0:19:18.30,Default,,0,0,0,,还有…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.09,0:19:21.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我想跟你和好
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.64,0:19:29.52,Default,,0,0,0,,原来我们是可以和好的关系啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.06,0:19:31.94,Default,,0,0,0,,小…小荠?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.48,0:19:35.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我们只是肉体上的关系  你却说想要和好?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.27,0:19:37.94,Default,,0,0,0,,你能不能暂时别往这上面扯…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.90,0:19:40.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我真的没有生气
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.32,0:19:42.91,Default,,0,0,0,,只是有点愤怒
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.61,0:19:46.03,Default,,0,0,0,,生气和愤怒有区别吗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.74,0:19:49.08,Default,,0,0,0,,你朋友是不是叫朝井来着
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.50,0:19:53.54,Default,,0,0,0,,她不是劝你一起去学校吗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.96,0:19:55.88,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么没立刻回答
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.09,0:20:01.38,Default,,0,0,0,,啊  你在意这个来着?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.97,0:20:05.47,Default,,0,0,0,,呃  嗯…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.85,0:20:10.81,Default,,0,0,0,,小荠  我现在不可能去学校
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.35,0:20:11.64,Default,,0,0,0,,啊?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.23,0:20:13.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我当时没能说出口
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.48,0:20:18.61,Default,,0,0,0,,是因为我不可能对人类的朋友说「我想变成吸血鬼  所以不去」
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.07,0:20:21.53,Default,,0,0,0,,不知道该怎么跟她说
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.99,0:20:25.07,Default,,0,0,0,,有道理
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.24,0:20:26.78,Default,,0,0,0,,是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.16,0:20:31.41,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.83,0:20:32.75,Default,,0,0,0,,在流血呢
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.29,0:20:35.17,Default,,0,0,0,,刚才摔倒了…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.33,0:20:39.17,Default,,0,0,0,,哎呀  出了很多血呢
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.67,0:20:40.67,Default,,0,0,0,,你在说什…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.52,0:20:58.27,Default,,0,0,0,,你说人类  那也就是说你有吸血鬼的朋友咯
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.53,0:21:04.15,Default,,0,0,0,,今天就吸这么多了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.15,0:21:07.57,Default,,0,0,0,,明天见  我的朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.41,0:21:13.33,Default,,0,0,0,,小荠…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.37,0:21:16.25,Default,,0,0,0,,朋友之间…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.42,0:21:19.25,Default,,0,0,0,,不会亲嘴啊
Comment: 0,0:00:01.00,0:00:01.00,Comment,,0,0,0,,
